# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RemapCopilotKey - Git 排除规则
#
# 约定：
#   1) 编译产物（中间文件、可执行文件、符号、日志）一律不入库
#   2) 改动文档 / 变更记录不入库（见文件末尾「改动文档」小节）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- 通用编译产物 ---------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]uild/
[Oo]ut/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
# 生产版打包产物（tools\package.ps1 输出到这里）
[Aa]rtifacts/
x64/
x86/
ARM64/
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.obj
*.o
*.a
*.res
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.log
*.idb
*.pch
*.bsc
*.map

# --- Visual Studio --------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.sln.docstates
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.opendb
*.aps
*.ncb
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.cachefile
UpgradeLog*.htm
UpgradeLog*.XML

# --- .NET / C# ------------------------------------------------------------
src/Configurator/bin/
src/Configurator/obj/
*.userprefs
project.lock.json
*.nuget.g.props
*.nuget.g.targets

# --- 运行期产物 -----------------------------------------------------------
# 服务程序运行日志
*.runtime.log
logs/
log/

# --- 侦察 / 临时产物 ------------------------------------------------------
_recon/
scratch/
tmp/
*.tmp

# --- 改动文档 -------------------------------------------------------------
# 按需求：改动文档不入库。
# 如需让某个文档入库，用 `git add -f <文件>` 强制加入。
CHANGELOG*
docs/changes/
docs/改动记录/
*.changes.md
*.changelog.md

# --- 代码签名私钥与证书 -----------------------------------------------
# 绝对不能入库；用 tools\sign.ps1 在仓库外管理
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pvk
*.snk
